#    2.047 -- 11Sep2017  (xqy) -- bug fix for nmini_bdy, and nfusi_bdy
#    2.048 -- 26Feb2018  (xqy) -- add support dQedGrdte,dQedGrdti,dQidGrdte,dQidGrdti
#    2.049 -- 2018/06/08 (jss) -- added check for arrays coming out of intrinsic transfer
#                                 function allocated with length 0
#    2.050 -- 2018/12/05 (xqy) -- add density and temperature fluctuation spectrum
#    2.051 -- 2019/05/05 (jss) -- added variables for toroidal and poloidal mode number for LH
#    2.052 -- 2019/08/28 (xqy) -- defined number of grid points for ky grid (anomalous data over
#                                 ky spectrum and for mmm model), removed ky_anonmth and ky_mmm
