#    2.053 -- 2019/09/16 (jss) -- Add poloidal momentum diffusivity and impurity diffusivity for MMM
#    2.054 -- 2020/05/27 (jss) -- Added pellet source terms and PEL component, will need future mods
#    2.055 -- 2020/06/10 (jss) -- Added output variables for the MTM model
#
#    2.056 -- 2022/12/14 (fmp) -- LH component has been modified as follows:
#                                 phigrilh removed => not needed because of assumption of toroidal symmetry
#                                 heghilh, thegrilh, rhopsi0lh, nthinlh have been resized to depend only on the antenna index.
#                                 These geometrical parameters should have the same value for all lobes in teh spectrum.
